ect "controller" (path "/9dba1312-bd1c-50b2-9df7-fc81461aaf77" (page "6"))))) (text "SWD / TTL / optional CAN / four MCU status LEDs" (at 147.32 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8744f96d-9963-5475-960d-5f3589677c48")) (text "Local 3.3 V / supervisor / buffered CTRL_READY" (at 271.78000000000003 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "94d7d2ed-8e28-5406-8d45-5accde2496ae")) (text "Headers / ADC input protection / BASE_READY" (at 22.86 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2835ab94-f3d3-5da5-89d9-6c2466f4776c")) (text "Retained: eight ADC filters, two ABZ, two SPI, TTL, SWD, optional DNP CAN/HSE and four MCU status LEDs.\nLocal 3.3 V and supervisor are independent from the power-baseboard 3.3 V rail. Sensor 5 V links remain DNP.\nThis common-ground design is replaceable but not galvanically isolated; electrical, fault, insertion and thermal review remain open.\nOld LKS controller files are historical and are not overwritten by this project." (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9042e2e4-4d4a-58f5-a20b-c83615c863b3")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
